  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: Concepts that represent system-instantiated orders and associated interventions derived from a Portable Medical Order (PMO) form, such as POLST or MOLST.),(Data Element Scope: ncludes SNOMED CT and LOINC codes representing categories and detailed types of system instanciated medical orders derived from a PMO form.),(Inclusion Criteria: This Grouped set is comprised of PACIO defined PMO related order type value sets: \nCardiopulmonary Resuscitation Procedures Grouping \nInitial Treatment Portable Medical Order Procedures Grouping\nMedically Assisted Nutrition Portable Medical Order Procedures Grouping),(Exclusion Criteria: Other value sets and codes not typically associated with end of life decisions.)",
